{"name":"Chavyondat","status":"ok","title":"Chavyondat","pageId":36453,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Chavyondat\" title=\"Category:Maps of Chavyondat\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Chavyondat</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Klionna<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p62_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p62-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Capital city</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Estagund\" title=\"Estagund\">Estagund</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Shining_Lands\" title=\"Shining Lands\">Shining Lands</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Metropolis</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Durpari\" title=\"Durpari\">Durpari</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halflings</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p128_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p128-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chauntea\" title=\"Chauntea\">Chauntea</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sheela_Peryroyl\" title=\"Sheela Peryroyl\">Sheela Peryroyl</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p128_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p128-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cyrrollalee\" title=\"Cyrrollalee\">Cyrrollalee</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Adama\" title=\"Adama\">Adama</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS-p122_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p122-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">25,000<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p62_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p62-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1367_DR\" title=\"1367 DR\">1367 DR</a><br/>80,000<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p128_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p128-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Chavyondat\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Chavyondat\">Inhabitants of  Chavyondat</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX0NoYXZ5b25kYXQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Category:Locations in Chavyondat (page does not exist)\">Locations in  Chavyondat</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Chavyondat\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Chavyondat\">Organizations in  Chavyondat</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Chavyondat</b> was a port city and the capital of <a href=\"/wiki/Estagund\" title=\"Estagund\">Estagund</a>.  It was the largest city in that realm.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p128_2-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p128-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Chavyondat was formerly known as <b>Klionna</b>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p53_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p53-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Defenses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Defenses</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chavyondat?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Situated on the protective <a href=\"/wiki/Bay_of_Kings\" title=\"Bay of Kings\">Bay of Kings</a> on the southern coast of Estagund, Chavyondat was the first line of defense against raiders from <a href=\"/wiki/Dambrath\" title=\"Dambrath\">Dambrath</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p62_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p62-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chavyondat?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Shou_Lung\" title=\"Shou Lung\">Shou Lung</a> was working intrigues to establish an enclave—a <a class=\"mw-redirect mw-disambig\" href=\"/wiki/Shou_Town\" title=\"Shou Town\">Shou Town</a>—in Chavyondat in Estagund in the mid-1370s <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Defenses\">Defenses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Defenses\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chavyondat?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Defenses\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Chavyondat was guarded by a corps of skilled crossbowmen and powerful <a href=\"/wiki/Illusionist\" title=\"Illusionist\">illusionists</a>. Additionally, <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2hha2FfU2VsdGFyaXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Chaka Seltarir (page does not exist)\">Chaka Seltarir</span> supplied 10 fully-armed warships to supplement the 5 used by the city.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p62_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p62-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chavyondat?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfdGhlX0FkYW1hP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"House of the Adama (page does not exist)\">House of the Adama</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQ2hha2FzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"House of Chakas (page does not exist)\">House of Chakas</span> – The home of Estagund's bureaucracy.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfdGhlX1ZhbnF1aXNoZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"House of the Vanquisher (page does not exist)\">House of the Vanquisher</span> – Training ground for the military.</li>\n<li>Marketplace - The largest ward in Chavyondat, where just about anything was for sale.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2VsdHJhcmlyX1BhbGFjZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Seltrarir Palace (page does not exist)\">Seltrarir Palace</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chavyondat?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span cl